      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapMethod on BasketBlockEntity.getCaptureItems: the same getFacingCollectionArea call, then per box (remembered per immutable shape object) getLevelX/Y/Z and the same getEntitiesOfClass call in order; one box: the query's own fresh ArrayList, several: their concatenation; no stream, flat map or collector",
